changes.why_more_alike:
Today 12 of 11×... combos are tested once each:
- with 1 seed, no aux, a fixed reference;
- ignoring the calibrated pct and prosody against the real recording;
- skipping failures.
Per-clip pct SD is about 3–6 points (research/sv_benchmark/记录.md: e.g. −2.6 ± 4.3), so 20 single samples cannot separate checkpoints. More checkpoints, items and seeds, the same conditions as generation, ground-truth prosody comparison, and a statistical tie rule make the pick much more likely to be the model that sounds most like her.

