changes.why_more_alike:
Official wiki (research/gsv_v4_v5/记录.md):
- V4 fine-tuning gives timbre similarity close to V5;
- the V4/V5 route is more faithful to the reference on high-quality training data, with a higher quality ceiling;
- her material is described as studio quality.
v4's 48 kHz vocoder may keep high-frequency detail that v2ProPlus at 32 kHz cannot. The judge cannot measure above 8 kHz, so the per-sentence pick is by measured similarity and accuracy, and the blind test is recommended for the ear.

