changes.change:
Twin reference pool of 32 clips, kept separate from references.json so other tiers are untouched.
Score of each clip: _score + typicality (−0.5 · mean z² of the clip's own prosody and LTAS against her distribution) + the precise-judge pct instead of resemblyzer.
Tags: kind, English share, paragraph-initial (gap_before at or above her paragraph threshold), paragraph-final, syllables.
For each sentence, the top R=4 references by context match:
