Tries rotate across the 4 references. After 8 tries, successive halving drops the 2 references whose best twin total is lowest. The aux set alternates between {0, 3} when the backend supports aux.
Per-reference running stats (mean twin total, shrinkage k=5) are kept in cache/twin_ref_stats.json and break ties. English-heavy segments prefer English-heavy references, with prompt_lang zh (LangSegmenter handles the mix).

